OL,3,GNEWSA'They know we're powerless': On
OL,4,Athe shoplifting front line in Greggs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is 09:30 BST at Greggs in Bearwood,
OL,7,Fnear Birmingham, and the first
OL,8,Fshoplifter of the day has already
OL,9,Fwalked out with a can of Red Bull.
OL,11,FLess than 30 minutes later, two men
OL,12,Fwith rucksacks do not bother to hide
OL,13,Ftheir faces as they ransack the fridge
OL,14,Ffor more, swearing angrily at a female
OL,15,Fworker who tries to stop them.
OL,17,FThe scene unfolds right in front of our
OL,18,FBBC team - we've just arrived to talk
OL,19,Fto staff and customers about
OL,20,Fshoplifting.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
