OL,3,GNEWSA'They know we're powerless': On
OL,4,Athe shoplifting front line in Greggs
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers tell us the brazen 55-second
OL,7,Fraid is all in a day's work, with
OL,8,Foffenders targeting the outlet multiple
OL,9,Ftimes every day.
